Error [E0975]: the service `ssh` has no `enable`
  --> config.jet:1:55
    |
  1 | module m { system.s: { target: linux.x64, services: { ssh: { ports: [22] } } } }
    |                                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: U12: every `Service` says whether it is on with a required `enable` flag, then any further settings
 Fix: add `enable: true` (or `false`) to `ssh`
